{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25926","headline":"游山 · 鲍溶","name":"游山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白道行深云，云高路弥细。\n时时天上客，遗路人间世。\n烟花最深处，井臼得空刺。\n天寒鹤巢林，石长泉脉闭。\n神化万灵集，心期一朝契。\n不见金板书，谁知阮家裔。\n终期太古人，问取松柏岁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}